# Written by scripts/responsive-audit.mjs on every run: a report plus a
# screenshot per viewport. Build output, not source — CI uploads it as an
# artifact, and locally it is rewritten (the script rm -rf's the directory
# first) each time the audit runs.
responsive-audit-output/
